{
  "title": "Warm Smoky Dutch Peanut Butter Stew",
  "description": "A comforting and flavorful Dutch dish featuring peanut butter and a smoky heat, perfect for a chilly evening. This egg-free friendly recipe is made with fresh ingredients and is sure to become a favorite.",
  "cuisine": "Dutch",
